	// Cases:
	// - ExprStmt (call as statement): report (unless excluded/ignored)
	// - DeferStmt (Defer field == call): report
	// - GoStmt (Call == call): report
	// - AssignStmt (Rhs contains call): if blank handling? Need to handle assignments where call is on RHS.
	// - ValueSpec (Values contains call): similar to AssignStmt (var decl)
